<title>USA: Alliance Q3 shr loss $0.23 vs profit $0.03.</title>
<headline>Alliance Q3 shr loss $0.23 vs profit $0.03.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>ALLIANCE ENTERTAINMENT CORP.</p>
<p>			  OPERATING RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER</p>
<p>			  AND NINE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(In millions except per share data)</p>
<p>			   Third Quarter Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				September 30,	 September 30,</p>
<p>			   1996	 1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net Sales	    $160.6     $182.5	$500.0	$491.5</p>
<p> Net income (loss)   (9.4)	  1.0	(36.0)	   5.3</p>
<p> Earnings (loss)/shr (0.23)	 0.03	(0.95)	  0.14</p>
<p>Weighted avg. shares</p>
<p>  outstanding   40,562,141  38,466,650  37,798,670  36,704,040</p>
<p>* Earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization includes non-recurring charges of $20.4 million for the nine months ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Included in the $20.4 million is $17.9 million of non- recurring charges relating to consolidation and restructuring of certain of the Company's one-stop distribution operations as well as charges relating to the current industry climate. The additional $2.5 million relates to the termination of the Company's merger agreement with Metromedia.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
